  "body": "Fixes #85 by creating a new category of elements which cannot be shadow\nhosts, and porting over the list from the shadow DOM specification.\n\nSee also https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/110#issuecomment-137114260.\n\nThis is also related to #86, as currently the list corresponds to\nelements whose rendering is defined with a binding property, but we\nwant to remove the binding stuff anyway.\n\nR= @rniwa, @hayatoito.\n\nPlus could use some careful review from other editors to make sure I'm doing this introducing a new category thing right. (It really sucks; I wish it were all auto-generated from one central source.)\n",
